"Reconnect this bot to retrieve its signing key. DocsBot will keep the widget "
"paused until private signing is ready."
msgstr ""
"Reconnectez ce bot pour récupérer sa clé de signature. DocsBot maintiendra "
"le widget en pause jusqu’à ce que la signature privée soit prête."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:617
